			"notes": "This release officially backports **Not Enough Calculator v3.0.0** from **Minecraft 26.2** to **Minecraft 26.1.x**!\n\nNote: Most of the Skyblock API related features in v3.0.0 were suggested by AI and made with AI.\n\nThis release has some overkill stuff thats more than what users need. We already know that lol. Honestly, when making this version, we genuinely werent EVEN sure what we were thinking or what we were even doing with our lives lol.\n\nWe’re not saying sorry for this one xd\n\nIf you prefer a version without all the Skyblock API stuff or AI slop, which you most probably do, I know, I know. WHAT YOU GUYZ ARE THINKING, WE CAN HEAR YOU. You can use [v2.7.1](https://modrinth.com/mod/notenoughcalculator/version/2.7.1) instead.\n\nRead all the features in this release here:  \n**[v3.0.0 Release Notes & Features](https://github.com/Rijzzz/NotEnoughCalculator/releases/tag/v3.0.0)**\n\nSpecial Thanks:\n- A massive thanks to **[@kaori-23](https://github.com/kaori-23)** for doing the 26.1.x backport in [#18](https://github.com/Rijzzz/NotEnoughCalculator/pull/18)!\n\nBug Reports:\n- If you run into any bugs or issues with the 26.1.x backport, please report them on [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/Rijzzz/NotEnoughCalculator/issues/new) or in our [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/asPJ4qgs8q)!\n\n**Full Changelog:** https://github.com/Rijzzz/NotEnoughCalculator/compare/v2.7.1...v3.0.0-Backport-26.1.x"
