			"notes": "Fixes & Improvements:\n- Settings GUI Fix (`/calcconfig`): Fixed `/calcconfig` command failing to open the settings screen in production builds by replacing non-remapped reflection string lookups with direct API calls.\n- Escape Key & Exit Flow: Fixed Escape key and Cancel button handling so closing the settings menu when opened from chat returns players smoothly back to gameplay.\n- Heuristics & Typing Detection: Expanded `isExpressionComplete()` heuristic regex in `CalculatorManager` to cover all 26 supported functions (`bz`, `ah`, `ahbin`, `fmt`, `hex`, `bin`, `oct`, `rad`, `deg`, etc.), preventing premature error popups while typing.\n- Dependency & Version Updates: Updated target build for **Minecraft 1.21.11** with updated Fabric API (`0.141.6`), REI (`21.11.816`), and ModMenu (`17.0.1-beta.1`).\n\n**Full Changelog:** https://github.com/Rijzzz/NotEnoughCalculator/compare/v2.5.0-Backport-1.21.11...v2.5.1-Backport-1.21.11"
